  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Durable Solutions: Fostering Peaceful Coexistence and Sustainable Reintegration for IDPs in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to durable solutions to internal displacement by building processes that enable voluntary, safe and dignified access to solutions through addressing individual and communal barriers. This will be achieved by improving conditions that enable IDPs to voluntarily return, locally (re)integrate, or settle in new locations or areas of origin in a sustainable manner, including through strengthening social cohesion within the communities through IOM&#x2019;s community stabilization approach.</narrative>
  </description>
